title <size:24>Deployment View: Pizzaco Order Service - Proposed Production</size>\n<size:24>PROPOSED, NOT AS-BUILT. The repo has no Dockerfile, no compose file, no k8s manifests and no Spring profiles, so nothing on this page exists yet. It shows what productionising the current containers would require: an external PostgreSQL in place of the embedded H2, TLS and authentication at the edge, and more than one task.</size>

